WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.784
Benjamin gulped.

2
00:00:06.785 --> 00:00:10.628
Peter dropped a few candies.

3
00:00:10.629 --> 00:00:13.787
"You lost your boot?" he said.

4
00:00:13.788 --> 00:00:18.694
"Yes!" the mouse cried.

5
00:00:18.695 --> 00:00:22.514
"What will I do?"

6
00:00:22.515 --> 00:00:24.150
Peter thought fast.

7
00:00:24.151 --> 00:00:30.590
"We'll look for your house."

8
00:00:30.591 --> 00:00:34.958
The bunnies hopped back to the shop.

9
00:00:34.959 --> 00:00:38.353
"We need the boot," Benjamin said.

10
00:00:38.354 --> 00:00:40.722
The shopkeeper shook his head.

11
00:00:40.723 --> 00:00:42.933
"Sorry," he said.

12
00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:45.708
"Mrs. Tiggywinkle just bought it."

13
00:00:45.709 --> 00:00:48.798
"Oh no," Peter said.

14
00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:55.277
"We must find Mrs. Tiggywinkle," Benjamin said.

15
00:00:55.278 --> 00:00:58.973
The bunnies hopped fast to Mrs. Tiggywinkle's house.

16
00:00:58.974 --> 00:01:02.114
Candies fell out of their pockets.

17
00:01:02.115 --> 00:01:06.104
But they did not see them.

18
00:01:06.105 --> 00:01:15.461
The bunnies knocked on Mrs. Tiggywinkle's door.

19
00:01:15.462 --> 00:01:18.577
"Do you have the boot?" Peter asked.

20
00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.915
Mrs. Tiggywinkle sighed.

21
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:24.507
"I painted a pretty picture on it.

22
00:01:24.508 --> 00:01:27.497
I wanted to use it for dirty socks.

23
00:01:27.498 --> 00:01:31.802
But it was too heavy."

24
00:01:31.803 --> 00:01:35.585
Peter grinned. "Can we have it?"

25
00:01:35.586 --> 00:01:38.826
"No," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

26
00:01:38.827 --> 00:01:41.427
She held up an old hat.

27
00:01:41.428 --> 00:01:43.762
"Jemima gave me this hat.

28
00:01:43.763 --> 00:01:50.241
I gave her the boot."

